<http://data.silknow.org/object/fbb84921-91c5-370f-bddc-4e32e9d8d69b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cotton panel printed in red with design entitled \"Telemachus and Calypso\" on white ground. Two-and-one-half repeats. Mythological scene depicting Telemachus and Calypso in woodland setting with attendants, enclosed in classical oval cartouche. Other classical and floral ornaments including putti, swags, urns, and medallions. Condition: Fair; square section cut out of one end."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2caafae3-6084-3769-8735-5d93189cf0c4> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Cotton panel printed in red with design entitled \"Telemachus and Calypso\" on white ground. Two-and-one-half repeats. Mythological scene depicting Telemachus and Calypso in woodland setting with attendants, enclosed in classical oval cartouche. Other classical and floral ornaments including putti, swags, urns, and medallions. Condition: Fair; square section cut out of one end."@en ;
